r 10-day average of 635K. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $52.14, and the chart ends at $52.14.","lesson":"This is an example of a textbook breakout: a base, then a close above it on heavy volume, and it held. This is the pattern the rules are built around."}}